<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nike cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nike cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Faye Landes downgraded Nike Inc to neutral from outperform, her office said.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 4-1/8 to 55-1/8.</p>
